{"2378250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tomb of Dread", "steam_appid": 2378250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caught in a sandstorm, the sand beneath your feet sinks as you fall into the darkness. There is (only) one path that leads inside a decrepit Tomb.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore dreadful environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in dark cave tunnels, architectural tomb halls, unnerving subterranean passages, and many more distinct areas. There are lots of secrets to be found that will reward the perceptive explorer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive with limited resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your weapons or wits to defeat a variety of vicious creatures with unpredictable AIs and unique behavioral patterns. Make sure to avoid too many stressful encounters, otherwise, your sanity will deteriorate and you will go mad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >avoid the ones who smile</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there is an entity that wants you to suffer. Don't let it defeat you. This world can be conquered_#there is no escape. There is only the endless void and sweet relief of death.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caught in a sandstorm, the sand beneath your feet sinks as you fall into the darkness. There is (only) one path that leads inside a decrepit Tomb.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore dreadful environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in dark cave tunnels, architectural tomb halls, unnerving subterranean passages, and many more distinct areas. There are lots of secrets to be found that will reward the perceptive explorer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive with limited resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your weapons or wits to defeat a variety of vicious creatures with unpredictable AIs and unique behavioral patterns. Make sure to avoid too many stressful encounters, otherwise, your sanity will deteriorate and you will go mad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >avoid the ones who smile</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there is an entity that wants you to suffer. Don't let it defeat you. This world can be conquered_#there is no escape. There is only the endless void and sweet relief of death.</p>", "short_description": "Survival horror inspired by Silent Hill, Amnesia and Tomb Raider. Trapped beneath the Egyptian sands you must find a way to survive_#beware the ones who smile", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378250/894959e3681b3c9cde8792ff25629c4bba8f8bff/header.jpg?t=1786311320", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378250/06e20c099d087da11a4c42ab82e1cff1942a9e2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786311320", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378250/06e20c099d087da11a4c42ab82e1cff1942a9e2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786311320", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 capable.<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra 10.13+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon, x64 architecture with SSE2.<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04, Ubuntu 18.04, and CentOS 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 architecture with SSE2 instruct